<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOULOUSE, France 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in</p>
<p>the $400,000 Toulouse Grand Prix men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Filip Dewulf (Belgium) beat Emilio Alvarez (Spain) 3-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Jordi Burillo (Spain) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>7-Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Younes El Aynaoui (Morocco)</p>
<p>6-3 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat Thierry Champion (France) 6-3 3-6</p>
<p>6-3</p>
</text>
